    {
      "kind" : "parameters",
      "parameters" : [
        {
          "content" : [
            {
              "inlineContent" : [
                {
                  "text" : "Invoked on the main thread with the call status and the hierarchical",
                  "type" : "text"
                },
                {
                  "text" : " ",
                  "type" : "text"
                },
                {
                  "text" : "result. Use the status to tell apart a successful prediction (which may still have nil",
                  "type" : "text"
                },
                {
                  "text" : " ",
                  "type" : "text"
                },
                {
                  "text" : "fields for individual activities) from a timeout \/ unavailable-sensor outcome.",
                  "type" : "text"
                }
              ],
              "type" : "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "name" : "callback"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "content" : [
        {
          "anchor" : "discussion",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Discussion",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The accelerometer sensor is started automatically, collects a fixed window of data, and is",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "stopped before the callback fires. The window length is determined by the bundled model",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "(currently ~3 seconds); customers don’t choose it because the SDK ships a single set of",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "models trained on that window. Expect the callback to fire ~3–4 seconds after the call.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The call is bounded by a hard timeout (~4 seconds). If CoreMotion fails to deliver enough",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "samples within that budget the callback fires once with ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "code" : ".timeout",
              "type" : "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text" : " and an empty result. On",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "devices without a usable motion sensor the callback fires on the main thread with",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "code" : ".sensorUnavailable",
              "type" : "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text" : ".",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind" : "content"
    }
  ],
